# Career Pipeline Overview

This workspace runs a structured job search: resume design, exports, and application tracking with AI-assisted workflows from the **career-pipeline** plugin.

## Folder map

| Folder | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| `design/` | Sample and working resume / cover letter HTML |
| `design/exports/` | Optional finished PDFs when you export |
| `leads/` | Company research profiles produced by `source-leads` |
| `submissions/` | Per-company, per-role application tracking |
| `submissions/.archive/` | Closed applications |

## Submissions path

Live: `submissions/<Company>/<Job Title>/`

## Leads path

Company research: `leads/<Company>.md`

## Personal context

Read workspace-root `.career-pipeline.yml` for salary floor, location preferences, target roles, background facts, and naming patterns. If missing, stop and point at `.career-pipeline.yml.example` / `career-pipeline-init`. Do not hardcode candidate-specific details in rules or skills. Setup: `docs/getting-started.md`. Field guide: plugin `docs/config.md` (or `docs/customization.md` in this workspace).

## Workflows

Invoke skills explicitly or via natural language: `career-pipeline-init`, `source-leads`, `analyze-job`, `initial-interview`, `next-interview`, `archive-job`. Require workspace-root `.career-pipeline.yml` (copy from `.career-pipeline.yml.example`). Human workflow guide: root `README.md`.
